    <Name>INT_2017_0412</Name>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2017_0412","fieldKey":"title"} -->
    <Title>About a dot, considered at length</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2017_0412","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2017-05-21</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2017_0412","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Dmitri Kowalczyk talks about the long argument with the colour blue. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</Description>
